I was, I was trying to get that, trying to get that butt speed in there.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.960
Yeah. I wouldn't say I felt weight to my character either.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.160
And I think here's where I'm going to start saying a couple negative things about the

