00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:32.260
gear one that you start in and then just like a hundred miles an hour.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.760
Yeah. Like a very, very fast, gradual buildup.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.060
