00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:15.320
And then it gets progressively harder, but also like just progressively different too.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:20.780
And then finally, the last thing you have to do is do the entire mountain in one shot.

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:23.140
Like after you've done all the segments, you do the entire mountain.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:29.420
And what kills this for me, and I don't really know a way to handle it, but if you get to

