00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:50.920
third segment. And so for me, it was like, I really wanted to like, even just snowy hill though, the hill

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:54.460
that's for beginners. I just wanted to beat that whole course.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:59.140
But every time I would get to the end, which would take a while, I would then have to like

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:05.440
be, you know, frame perfect and not necessarily frame perfect, but for a novice player frame

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.700
perfect to get through this course.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:08.640
