00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:10.860
So I was never actually able to beat any of them.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:15.500
I do feel like the, this, this has like a, the feel of one of those games where it's

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.480
where I would have, as a kid, I would have sunk a lot of time into like, I would have

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:22.360
been like, Oh, I, you know, I got to level five on snowy hill this time, but I'm gonna

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:25.080
keep playing it. And I'll, you know, you'd have my friend play it or whatever.

