00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:31.000
And like, I feel like this has got, I mean, I haven't played it enough to really say, but

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:33.440
I feel like this is one of those things where you get really, you have a really satisfying

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.540
feeling once you've accomplished like the course you were stuck on.

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.100
No, I agree with that.

